{"artifact_kind":"issue_comment","external_id":"issue_comment-4860004686","fetched_at":"2026-07-25T18:35:09.814290+00:00","raw":{"author_association":"NONE","body":"> Calling `onAllReady` when the shell errored was a bug we fixed in https://github.com/react/react/pull/36903.\n> \n> Calling `onAllReady` when Suspense boundaries failed i.e. when `onError` is called is intended behavior. React will flush the fallback and retry on the Client. If you want to not send anything when any boundary fails, you can ignore `onAllReady` if `onError` is called. `onAllReady` is always called after `onError`.\n\nBrilliant, thanks!","created_at":"2026-07-01T21:01:27Z","html_url":"https://github.com/react/react/issues/36890#issuecomment-4860004686","id":4860004686,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react/react/issues/36890","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAJy2Ks8AAAABIa3JTg","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react/react/issues/comments/4860004686/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-07-01T21:01:27Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react/react/issues/comments/4860004686","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15360667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperOleg39/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperOleg39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperOleg39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperOleg39/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SuperOleg39","id":15360667,"login":"SuperOleg39","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MzYwNjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperOleg39/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperOleg39/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperOleg39/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/user